---

<Base
  title={title}
  description={description}
  ogType="website"
  schema={[faqSchema, breadcrumbSchema, serviceSchema, itemListSchema]}
  canonical="https://golfgraeagle.com/graeagle-golf-packages/"
  ogImage={OG_IMAGE}
  preloadImage="/wp-images/grizzly-ranch-hero.webp"
  bodyClass="light-page"
>
  <Nav />

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO — AEO answer block + speakable
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="gp-hero" aria-label="Graeagle Golf Packages Overview">
    <div class="gp-bg" style="background-image:url(/wp-images/grizzly-ranch-hero.webp)" role="img" aria-label="Grizzly Ranch Golf Club — Golf Digest Top 100"></div>
    <div class="gp-overlay"></div>
    <div class="gp-hero-inner">
      <p class="gp-eyebrow reveal-up">Graeagle, California · Sierra Nevada · 5 Championship Courses · Est. 2004</p>
      <h1 class="gp-h1 reveal-up delay-1">Graeagle golf packages.<br/><em>All 5 courses. One quote.</em></h1>

      <!-- AEO answer block — speakable, crawlable, direct answer -->
      <div class="gp-aeo-answer speakable aeo-answer reveal-up delay-2" data-speakable>
        <p>Graeagle has five championship golf courses within 25 minutes of each other in the Sierra Nevada — Grizzly Ranch (Golf Digest Top 100), Whitehawk Ranch, Plumas Pines, Graeagle Meadows, and Nakoma The Dragon (Frank Lloyd Wright clubhouse). GolfGraeagle builds custom stay-and-play packages from $299 per golfer for groups of 2 to 200+, including guaranteed tee times, lodging, and a full day-by-day itinerary. Free quote within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gp-pills reveal-up delay-3">
        <span>From <strong>${minPrice}</strong>/golfer</span>
        <span>2–200+ golfers</span>
        <span>All 5 championship courses</span>
        <span>Free quote · 24hr response</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gp-ctas reveal-up delay-4">
        <a href={QUOTE_URL} class="btn-green-glow gp-btn">Get a Custom Package Quote →</a>
        <a href="/trips/" class="gp-ghost underline-draw">See real packages + pricing ↗</a>
      </div>
      <p class="gp-trust reveal-up delay-5">No commitment · Response within 24 hours · GolfGraeagle has operated in the valley since 2004</p>
    </div>
    <div class="gp-floats reveal-fade delay-5" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="gp-float"><div class="gp-float-val">5</div><div class="gp-float-lbl">Courses</div></div>
      <div class="gp-float"><div class="gp-float-val">25 min</div><div class="gp-float-lbl">Between courses</div></div>
      <div class="gp-float"><div class="gp-float-val">4.8★</div><div class="gp-float-lbl">672 Reviews</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       WHAT'S IN A PACKAGE — AEO structured answer
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="gp-section" aria-labelledby="whats-included-heading">
    <div class="gp-container" style="max-width:900px">
      <div class="gp-header reveal-up">
        <span class="sec-label">What GolfGraeagle packages include</span>
        <h2 class="gp-h2" id="whats-included-heading">One quote.<br/><em>Everything sorted.</em></h2>
        <p class="gp-subhead speakable">A Graeagle golf package from GolfGraeagle includes guaranteed tee times at your chosen courses, lodging matched to your group, and a day-by-day itinerary — all in a single proposal delivered within 24 hours. No calling pro shops. No hotel hunting. No logistics spreadsheet.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gp-included">
        {[
          { icon: '⛳', title: 'Guaranteed tee times at all 5 courses', body: 'Direct pro shop relationships — including semi-private Grizzly Ranch, which the public cannot book for group play. Your tee times are locked before you leave home.' },
          { icon: '🏘', title: 'Lodging matched to your group', body: 'From Frank Lloyd Wright lodge rooms steps from The Dragon first tee, to on-course townhomes adjacent to Plumas Pines. Matched to your group size, budget, and what kind of stay the trip deserves.' },
          { icon: '📋', title: 'Full day-by-day itinerary', body: 'Courses sequenced by difficulty and drive time. Harder courses later in the trip when your game is dialled. Dining recommendations woven in. Nothing left for you to figure out.' },
          { icon: '⚡', title: 'Full proposal back in 24 hours', body: 'Tell Mike your dates, group size, and which courses interest you. He builds the full package and sends it back within a business day. Free, no commitment required to receive it.' },
