        <p class="gp-subhead speakable" data-speakable>The five Graeagle golf courses are Grizzly Ranch Golf Club (Golf Digest Top 100), Graeagle Meadows Golf Course, Whitehawk Ranch Golf Course, Plumas Pines Golf Resort, and Nakoma — The Dragon. All five sit within 25 minutes of each other. Most groups play 2 to 4 courses over a long weekend.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Course comparison table — AEO structured data on-page -->
      <div class="gp-table-wrap reveal-up">
        <table class="gp-table" aria-label="Graeagle golf courses comparison">
